                        "sense_id": "ba5eb96c-e387-363e-90dd-2de57f0a3805",
                        "entry_id": "fe53d661-5cda-3e56-a212-d3305dcbf1be",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A style of facial hair which has both a mustache and a goatee but with all cheek hair shaven, popular in Europe in the 17th century."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5cf6b587-8f83-4407-9ffd-f47a9532391b",
                                "sense_id": "ba5eb96c-e387-363e-90dd-2de57f0a3805",
                                "text": "He was still an old galliard, with white Buffalo Bill vandyke, and he swanked around, still healthy of flesh, in white suits, looking things over with big sex-amused eyes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6f83082c-634f-444a-a392-880ef7320d01",
                                "sense_id": "ba5eb96c-e387-363e-90dd-2de57f0a3805",
                                "text": "Raj, you will be painting sideburns and a Van Dyke on a six-inch figurine of Legolas the elf."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b1b7d28e-7bab-35ba-a7c0-dc9bc46bbf5c",
                        "entry_id": "fe53d661-5cda-3e56-a212-d3305dcbf1be",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A style of dress or collar similar to those in Anthony van Dyck's portrait paintings; a small round cape, the border ornamented with points and indentations."
